HELLO V1 GAME "Mob Gallery" PROTO 1
VIEW LOGICAL_W 1024 LOGICAL_H 576 TILE_W 32 TILE_H 32

CLS
BG 176 163 170 255

# FONT_LOAD 1 "../assets/AtkinsonHyperlegible-Regular.ttf" 64
FONT_LOAD 2 "../assets/AtkinsonHyperlegible-Bold.ttf"    64
